[{"id":3502048341,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7QvQRV","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","login":"HolonProduction","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction"},"body":"I am able to reproduce the original issue and can confirm that this patch fixes it.\r\n\r\nI'm approving based on testing and the approach using a `HashSet`.\r\n\r\nI'm not approving the specific implementation using a `thread_local`. I'm no c++ wizard and don't know if it's a sensible approach.\r\n\r\nEdit: I'm also approving that this is the right place to fix the issue. EditorFileSystem is not responsible for this.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112923#pullrequestreview-3502048341","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112923","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-24T20:01:18Z"},{"id":3502209439,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Qv3mf","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"The proposed solution should work, but I don't think `thread_local` is necessary here.\r\n\r\nInstead, i would like to propose using a parameter (on a helper function) to track visitations. I think this should work the same way, but it would be a little easier to reason about.\r\nI've added the implementation as (i think?) a complete suggestion (except the `.h` file), but it would need to be tested.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112923#pullrequestreview-3502209439","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112923","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-24T20:59:32Z"},{"id":3510757328,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7RQefQ","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112923#pullrequestreview-3510757328","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112923","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-26T12:36:45Z"},{"id":3510806975,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7RQqm_","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112923#pullrequestreview-351080